This repository is licensed per package. Check the package you are consuming.

  packages/core  (@gullabs/flipbook-core)
      Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0  —  packages/core/LICENSE

  packages/react (@gullabs/react-flipbook)
      MIT License  —  packages/react/LICENSE

  Everything else — examples, fixtures, e2e, scripts, docs and build tooling —
  is MIT, under the notice below.

Why the split: the flip engine in packages/core is the substance of this fork,
and MPL-2.0 is file-level copyleft. You may use, embed and ship it inside a
closed-source or commercial product with no obligation and no license
requirement on your own code. If you modify the engine's own source files,
those modified files must be made available under MPL-2.0.

The React binding is a thin wrapper and stays MIT so it can be vendored or
adapted without friction.

"GulLabs", "@gullabs" and the GulLabs name and logo are trademarks of GulLabs.
These licenses grant rights to the code, not to the marks. See the Trademark
section of README.md.

